And he says to them, You

          {+}
         come yourselves apart into a desert place, and rest awhile. For there were many coming and going, and they had no leisure so much as to eat.

But he answered and said to them, You

          {+}
         give them to eat. And they say to him, Shall we go and buy $20,000 worth of bread, and give them to eat?

And he says to them, How many loaves do you

          {+}
